Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Avant le Déluge…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.63,0:00:02.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}des êtres\Nvenus du ciel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.99,0:00:04.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}sont descendus\Nsur Terre.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.13,0:00:06.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Et ils n'auraient\Njamais dû.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:09.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Au temps de Jared,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:11.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}les hommes se\Nmultipliaient
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:12.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}sur la Terre.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.96,0:00:14.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Et leurs filles étaient
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:15.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}d'une grande\Nbeauté.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:19.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Dans les cieux,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:21.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}des anges les\Nobservaient.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:22.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}On les appelait\Nles Veilleurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:30.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Leur chef,\NShemihaza,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.23,0:00:31.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}prit la parole :
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.33,0:00:32.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}« Choisissons\Ndes épouses
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:33.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}parmi les humains. »
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:41.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Mais il avait peur.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:43.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}« Je crains\Nd'être le seul à
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:44.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}payer pour ce\Ngrand péché. »
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:54.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Alors tous jurèrent\Nensemble,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:56.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}et ils se lièrent par\Nune malédiction :
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.85,0:00:58.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}personne ne\Nreculerait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.07,0:01:07.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Ils étaient\Ndeux cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.79,0:01:09.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Ils descendirent\Nsur le
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.17,0:01:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}sommet du\Nmont Hermon…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.95,0:01:11.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Et la Terre allait
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.71,0:01:12.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}changer pour\Ntoujours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.11,0:01:21.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Mais ce qu'ils\Nallaient
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.97,0:01:23.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}enseigner aux\Nhommes…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.65,0:01:24.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}était bien plus\Ndangereux
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.87,0:01:25.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}que leur serment.
